  characterName: Ama Koranteng
  promptText: 'An export firm offers a long contract to plant cocoa across our communal
    forest: steady cash and guaranteed buyers. But the plan replaces mixed forest
    with monoculture, less river flow, fewer wild foods, and seasonal wage work for
    us. Do I sign?'
  leftAnswer: Yes, sign the contract for steady income and market access.
  rightAnswer: No, refuse; keep the mixed forest that feeds and shelters you.
